    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three great games in one!</h2><br>He's a dad AND a radish! Join Dadish on his quest to rescue his missing kids in three classic platforming adventures. Dadish Collection combines Dadish, Dadish 2 and Dadish 3 in one rad package.<br><br>\u2022 Three acclaimed retro platformers in one<br>\u2022 Dialogue that is funny-ish<br>\u2022 150 awesome levels to beat<br>\u2022 Tons of rude and sassy baby radishes to find<br>\u2022 A whole bunch of fast food foes<br>\u2022 15 ridiculously unhealthy bosses<br>\u2022 Lots of screechy possums<br>\u2022 The joys of fatherhood x3<br>\u2022 The soundtrack slaps<br>\u2022 The graphics are good if you like that sort of thing<br>\u2022 Heaps of collectable stars<br>\u2022 3 unlockable secret characters",
